{"server":"en","storyId":"main_0_0_welcome_to_guide","groupId":"main_0","stageId":null,"title":"Prologue, Part 1","storyCode":"","avgTag":"Interlude","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/guide/beg/0_welcome_to_guide.txt","sourceHash":"5a22954023e554baebfdb27c2fa073415cd751a49e0e5eba77ee8c2ceaedad4a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"初始引导\nAh, it's you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"It's been a long time since we've last seen each other.\nDuring this time... you've been teetering on the edge of a cliff."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"You may have forgotten who you are, but just remembering your name is enough."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"...It's time. Don't linger here for too long.\nAfter all, you aren't my guest yet, nor should you even be here.\nShe still needs you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"December 23rd.\nYou may not remember what this date means to you.\nAnd this will thrust you into peril.\n......\nNo...\nYou must try to remember."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...consciousness..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Circulation resumed... vitals stabilized... cardioplegia solution injected..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Body temperature low... administering Hexamethasone 20 c.c., now..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Get the hemostat!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Conditions stable... beginning resection... be careful of VFib..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Sorry..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Distant Voice","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"For making you suffer again..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...hand!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Take my..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Take my hand!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Emergency..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Help..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...It's done...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, Doctor!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Medic, how's Doctor doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But, just a moment ago... we were holding hands..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"So why... why is Doctor still not waking up...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! Don't panic, just calm down first!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah... S-sorry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"You always get so flustered when it comes to the doctor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"But, Amiya, if the worst came to pass... what would you do then?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm already mentally prepared for that. We would continue to follow the plan."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"...I understand. Anyway, I'll do what you requested."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"All right... I appreciate it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"About the Doctor..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry, Amiya. All the vital signs are stable now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll do one more inspection, just for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you... Thank you very much!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Mhm. Breathing is slightly shallow, but blood pressure is normal. There should be no cause for concern."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you awake?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, it's a success! The Doctor has woken up!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm so happy... Doctor..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, careful! You mustn't do that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't try to move yet. Your body still hasn't fully adapted to this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor...?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Who... are you?","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, Doctor... It's me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's me, Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We've come to rescue you."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"...Who... am I...?","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You're a member of Rhodes Island, just like us..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...as well as my partner."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You're the most important person to me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor... you don't remember?"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"...Can I trust you?","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand. I know this is a bit much to take in right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't expect you to remember everything right away, and I'm not asking you to trust me right now."}]},{"label":"...","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}, do you really not remember me at all...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if that's the case... I won't give up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We've already sacrificed so much, just to find you..."}]},{"label":"I see... Pleased to meet you, Amiya.","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, um, hello."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I, I don't know how to put this, but so many things have changed from before."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That includes me as well."}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"However, you'll always be the most important person to me, Doctor. No matter what happens, this will never change."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"So that's why, please... give me a little more time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"However little it might be..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Does the doctor... really have amnesia?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sure everything will be fine if we give Doctor some space..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Where is this...","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's safe here—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? What's happening—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Heavily-Armed Man","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, we've got a problem!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Heavily-Armed Man","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Someone broke into the facility!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Heavily-Armed Man","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"The way they're dressed... they don't look like Ursus soldiers!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Heavily-Armed Man","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"What's the meaning of this?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Heavily-Armed Man","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"They're attacking! Amiya, they're heavily equipped with weapons!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaahh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful, everyone! Take cover, and protect Doctor!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"These outfits... are they from the Reunion Movement? But how is that possible..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Guards, prepare for battle!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Curses... Are they after the Doctor?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No... Nobody else should know about the Doctor being here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you able to reach Kal'tsit?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not sure why, but the equipment isn't working!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Someone has cut off our communications."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Have we been discovered by the Ursus government?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"What do we do now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Kal'tsit won't be able to command the battle as we had originally planned."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I hope that... you'll be able to take command."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Isn't that a bit too risky? The Doctor only just came to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'd like... to give it a try."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even without memories, Doctor has..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...fought alongside us before."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you for all of your guidance..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We've been through so much together..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor... I just know that you'll be able to do it."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I know that you'll lead us to victory."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand that asking you to do this is very sudden and inconsiderate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But... Please, lend us your aid."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll be supporting you!"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Let's push them back first!","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"...","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"We have no choice but to fight back, right?","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm... I don't want to drag you into this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But right now, we need your wisdom more than ever, Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I hope that a part of you will reawaken during combat."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even though you might have doubts about yourself..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But I believe in you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I know you can do this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Please take command... of Rhodes Island!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["???","Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["Guard","Heavily-Armed Man"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]}]}
